{"time": 1752421477, "type": "reply", "message_id": "442061438", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "开始记录乐谱"}
{"time": 1752421485, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2054058946", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file={232ACB48-5779-B960-6AE6-2A27D83DE8B7}.jpg,sub_type=1,url=https://gchat.qpic.cn/gchatpic_new/0/0-0-232ACB485779B9606AE62A27D83DE8B7/0,file_size=27382]"}
{"time": 1752421593, "type": "recv", "message_id": "816614559", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "在领主的大城堡里住了一个月了，你已经渐渐熟悉了这个大的没边的建筑，不得不说领主是真的有钱，他是商人起家，被任命为这片土地的领主，一是因为他的财富，二是因为此地是西林与东林的交界地，让一个商人当领主也能促进两边的贸易。"}
{"time": 1752421595, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2110340876", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（别急"}
{"time": 1752421603, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1556980829", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（大概要打五分钟吧"}
{"time": 1752422025, "type": "recv", "message_id": "390600706", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "如今的东林和西林的政治格局有很大的不同，东林基本上以城镇为单位，没有国家，塔及其下属的各魔法学院代领了行政机构的职能，每个城镇的旁边都有魔法学院，每个地区的最高话事人就是镇长以及魔法学院的院长；西林则是相当于群雄割据，没有像塔那样的庞然大物，有的是一个个割据的国家，按东林的说法，西林人非常的野性，很多喜欢研究稀奇古怪的东西的家伙都聚集在了这里，这也导致了这里的好战风气，况且西林本土面积相对其他三个地方相对较少，所以各国对土地极其的渴求，几乎每天都有国家之间的战争，你们所处的领地属于西林边陲的一个算是比较强的国家"}
{"time": 1752422065, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1598913874", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（好的）"}
{"time": 1752422096, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1632573583", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（别急）"}
{"time": 1752422299, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1643869811", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "你在领主家住的这段时间，法杖被收走了，但是领主并没有限制你的任何行动，你可以做任何你想做的事，包括出门（但你没有尝试过提出出远门的请求），他并不怕你会就此逃跑。领主家的其他人对你也算友善，把你当家庭教师对待，除了吉诺还是不理你，每次见到你都把你无视。"}
{"time": 1752422749, "type": "recv", "message_id": "878778008", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "格林因为比较的友善，与宅子里几乎所有的人关系都很好，领主也很喜欢这个小姑娘，整天说一些要帮她找门当户对的对象的胡话。从格林的口中你得知，吉诺是领主捡的孤儿，出钱供他去上林的剑神道观学习剑术，毕业后回来就成为了领主和安琪小姐的保镖，其实领主对他就像是亲生儿子，但是吉诺自己强烈要求要当保镖，那领主也只好作罢。吉诺对安琪有着恐怖的溺爱，就像是自己的亲生妹妹一样，所以他看见你在安琪房间中才会如此的着急。“其实吉诺是个很温和的家伙，他现在对你也没有敌意了，只是因为看不惯师傅你这样的态度，他才拉不下脸跟你和好”，格林如是说"}
{"time": 1752422785, "type": "recv", "message_id": "95960309", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（好像没什么要交代的了）"}
{"time": 1752422789, "type": "recv", "message_id": "793820326", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（哦还有学习进度）"}
{"time": 1752423296, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1423010772", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "小安琪学习魔法学的很快，她确实有点天赋，现在已经能释放一些比较低级的魔法了，虽然威力和实用性约等于0，但是毕竟才学了这么点时间；安琪学的比较快的魔法体系是火、风、雷、土，其他则进展缓慢，低阶和部分中阶的火系和土系魔法你倒是可以进行教学，但是具体联系到以后的发展，你感觉还是得去找专门的体系的魔法师进行教学，虽然学会中阶魔法就已经得花好几年的时间；格林倒是全属性的魔法都很擅长，但是她毕竟没有魔力，有些地方理解是错的，所以你不敢让她教学。"}
{"time": 1752423421, "type": "recv", "message_id": "177943554", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(跟我有1/2重合，那其实还行)"}
{"time": 1752423444, "type": "recv", "message_id": "921996060", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "最近时常会刷新出如下的温馨画面：领主出差回家后，安琪坐在领主的大腿上给他展示自己学会的魔法，领主也就笑得眼睛眯得像他的八字胡一样弯"}
{"time": 1752423460, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1026824292", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（没活了"}
{"time": 1752423487, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1877387564", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "然后现在是你熟悉教师生活后的某天早晨"}
{"time": 1752423538, "type": "recv", "message_id": "151442240", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(好的)"}
{"time": 1752424210, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1578357961", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(然后呢)"}
{"time": 1752424219, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1337711834", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(是到我吗)"}
{"time": 1752424286, "type": "recv", "message_id": "837094913", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（对啊"}
{"time": 1752424294, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1592730444", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（你要我给你安排吗（"}
{"time": 1752424323, "type": "recv", "message_id": "854062211", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1877387564]从床上起床，先盯着手腕上的镯子，皱皱眉，起身洗漱一下，穿好衣服去餐厅吃早餐"}
{"time": 1752424504, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1084659134", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "今天的早饭是奶油吐司面包配蘑菇汤"}
{"time": 1752424534, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2054948024", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "少见的领主在家过夜，所以他和安琪也在餐厅吃早饭"}
{"time": 1752424593, "type": "recv", "message_id": "14095462", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "点头表示打个招呼，看看格林在不在"}
{"time": 1752424635, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1074352321", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "不在餐厅，也许在赖床，最近她赖床的次数越来越多了"}
{"time": 1752424725, "type": "recv", "message_id": "700237584", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "叹口气，先去她房间找她"}
{"time": 1752424743, "type": "recv", "message_id": "927922060", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（你要敲门吗）"}
{"time": 1752424804, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1472182735", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "先看看能不能直接推开"}
{"time": 1752425014, "type": "recv", "message_id": "837650141", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "你直接把门推开，发现格林正在以一种很不淑女的姿势睡着，被子没有覆盖的大腿根部，睡裤下的白色内裤隐隐若现"}
{"time": 1752425087, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1783366283", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"唉..这丫头。\"走上前先把她被子盖好，然后坐在床头摇一摇她的肩膀"}
{"time": 1752425306, "type": "recv", "message_id": "732225566", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“唔......欸！师傅你怎么偷偷摸摸进我房间”"}
{"time": 1752425457, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1928235945", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"是你没锁门啦。\"扶着额头摇摇头"}
{"time": 1752425484, "type": "recv", "message_id": "156732454", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"睡得好不检点，这房子又不是只有我们两个，怎么不锁门。\""}
{"time": 1752425492, "type": "recv", "message_id": "240022676", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“又没有必要锁门……”"}
{"time": 1752425522, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1154478086", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"而且，天天睡懒觉。\"皱着眉，\"晚上干嘛去了?是不是有了新欢，不需要不中用的师傅了\""}
{"time": 1752425689, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2082865085", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“这才是年轻人该有的精神状态，一些老年人看起来起的早，但是实际上是垂垂暮年了”大脑开机后，格林也恢复了毒舌状态，只是你怀疑她如果平时也是这么和别人说话，是怎么和宅子里其他人打好关系的"}
{"time": 1752425821, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1633427539", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"算上去的话，阿桃已经两百来岁了，作为人类已经是高寿了。\"抓着她肩膀使劲摇晃"}
{"time": 1752425869, "type": "recv", "message_id": "486989613", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这么不检点的话，要不要下次和阿桃睡一起?有我看着，不锁门倒也没什么问题...\""}
{"time": 1752426050, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1468591102", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“你那半吊子次元魔法当然不能用来算寿命啊，话说快点松手啊变态师傅，我还要洗漱呢，再这样告你性骚扰了啊”"}
{"time": 1752426114, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1541486378", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "松开手，\"还不都是格林太不设防了？这又不是只有我们两个人。\"坐在床上，有一搭没一搭理着发梢"}
{"time": 1752426215, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1670699904", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“这里的大家都是挺好的人啊，虽然说当时产生了点误会，但是现在他们也没有为难我们，还给了我们挺好的待遇呢”"}
{"time": 1752426238, "type": "recv", "message_id": "233459755", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“没必要这么谨慎吧，你疑心太重”"}
{"time": 1752426258, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2011178363", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "格林向你做个鬼脸"}
{"time": 1752426339, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2016871326", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"你这丫头...\"抬起手，看着手上的手环，\"有这东西在，我们一天没有什么自保能力...\""}
{"time": 1752426395, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1525302278", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"好啦，格林要是再这样，今晚就搬到我房间好了。\"起身，\"毕竟阿桃是师傅嘛\""}
{"time": 1752426444, "type": "recv", "message_id": "693457578", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“那个是用来防你的，谁让师傅看起来就不像个好人嘛，你信不信我过几天向领主说要摘掉，他就帮我摘了”格林嘻嘻"}
{"time": 1752426450, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1903308587", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;动画表情&#93;,file=4BC8D9B74714068C636998F0F8FF252C.jpg,sub_type=1,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhQqhcG_k63UolI5ERld7XlyRId4YhjsOSD_CiiJ9LGgqbqOAzIEcHJvZFCAvaMBWhA6wbRlP2lXIbalatxyJO5tegKNzA&amp;rkey=CAMSMCr9b1mH4nGoWvd3J1b0gjCXJfIrXV3S7-uQmKU-VyR-1jN8X4omslDcAnCtiENbsg,file_size=7404]"}
{"time": 1752426523, "type": "recv", "message_id": "740706164", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"哼...不理你了。\"沉默了一会，起身推开门去餐厅"}
{"time": 1752426608, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1455085892", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "你又一次回到餐厅，领主和安琪已经吃完离开了"}
{"time": 1752426701, "type": "recv", "message_id": "625443320", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "找个空位坐下来，慢慢用餐"}
{"time": 1752426840, "type": "recv", "message_id": "663756365", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "你坐下以后，格林过一会也出现在了餐厅，和你一起用餐"}
{"time": 1752426945, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2043115226", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"虽然这些日子是很舒服啦...不过阿桃果然想更自由一些啊。\"有一搭没一搭挑着蘑菇汤"}
{"time": 1752427051, "type": "recv", "message_id": "841454867", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“等教学工作结束不就可以了吗？”"}
{"time": 1752427262, "type": "recv", "message_id": "128423715", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"感觉要好久诶...\"放下勺子，\"算了，出去走走，格林要一起吗\""}
{"time": 1752427356, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1884653521", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“也不是不行，今天是休息日吧，去哪里呢？”"}
{"time": 1752427485, "type": "recv", "message_id": "539478814", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不知道，反正现在没有魔力，好像不能去什么危险的地方。\"认命地叹口气，\"去最近的镇子逛逛?\""}
{"time": 1752427579, "type": "recv", "message_id": "868435989", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“嗯，也可以，去看看集市有什么东西卖吧”"}
{"time": 1752427692, "type": "recv", "message_id": "328551182", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"走吧。\"起身，带着她离开城堡去附近的镇子"}
{"time": 1752428095, "type": "recv", "message_id": "741067113", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "西林的镇子和东林稍有不同，不仅仅是建筑风格，连街道的分布样式也很不一样，东林和你之前在的赤龙山脉下的村庄，建筑都是以网格状排列的，而西林则是几座建筑围成一个圈，大圈套小圈，圈和圈又会相交，这就导致西林镇子的道路十分的复杂，你永远不知道究竟有多少条通往某个地方的近道。而集市则一般分散在每个圈的圆心处，从而方便所有人来购买，只是要逛所有的物品，就只能跑每个集市一个个扫过去了"}
{"time": 1752428165, "type": "recv", "message_id": "775931731", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"格林想要什么?阿桃倒是无所谓啦\""}
{"time": 1752428291, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1575844666", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“逛逛呗，也没有什么特定的想要的物品”"}
{"time": 1752428341, "type": "recv", "message_id": "628648391", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "那就走进集市一个摊子一个摊子看看"}
{"time": 1752428472, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1927030894", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "集市是分散在各个建筑园心，每个圆心都只有少数的几个摊子。你可以rd12来看每次到达的小集市有什么摊"}
{"time": 1752428552, "type": "recv", "message_id": "267957713", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。rd12"}
{"time": 1752428552, "type": "reply", "message_id": "267957713", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[天宫安]演奏出: 1D12=10"}
{"time": 1752428680, "type": "recv", "message_id": "122077005", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "你们来到了一个卖药草的摊子"}
{"time": 1752428721, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1240570593", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"哦?说起来，之前还是有不少药草的。\""}
{"time": 1752428791, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1154167955", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“嗯，那些药草还在我房间里放着呢，虽然最近没什么使用的机会啦”"}
{"time": 1752428915, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2146843467", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"上次不是有吗？\"俯下身子看看"}
{"time": 1752428927, "type": "recv", "message_id": "446863927", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"格林有没有需要备着的药草\""}
{"time": 1752428947, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1054205209", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（上次不是好久之前了吗（）"}
{"time": 1752429041, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1324696752", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(一个来月吧)"}
{"time": 1752429065, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1495237164", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“常用的用来疗伤的药草但是还有……嘛，倒是可以买些别的药草做实验用”"}
{"time": 1752429072, "type": "recv", "message_id": "293809858", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "过一个幸运吧"}
{"time": 1752429196, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1842268405", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。ra幸运"}
{"time": 1752429196, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1842268405", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[天宫安]进行技能[幸运:70]检定: 1D100=72 失败，人面不知何处去，桃花依旧笑春风"}
{"time": 1752429248, "type": "recv", "message_id": "123255266", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "这个摊子卖的药草都是一些比较常规的疗伤用药草，还有就是别的基础灵药的耗材"}
{"time": 1752429307, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1982114856", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"好像没什么特别的药材，看看别的地方?\""}
{"time": 1752429358, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1319289715", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“买点基础灵药的材料也可以，或许能教教安琪炼药”"}
{"time": 1752429443, "type": "recv", "message_id": "664837545", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"唔..那也可以。\"买一些基础的药材，拉着她去下一个摊位"}
{"time": 1752429446, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1043745427", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。rd12"}
{"time": 1752429446, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1043745427", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[天宫安]演奏出: 1D12=8"}
{"time": 1752429718, "type": "recv", "message_id": "411067163", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "这是一家卖武器的小摊，有卖冒险用的匕首，弓箭之类的物品，也提供武器的保养服务，比起东林的摊子，区别就是魔法师用装备的数量骤降，而且还有一些奇奇怪怪的装备比如指虎，流星锤等非常规武器"}
{"time": 1752429801, "type": "recv", "message_id": "505104993", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"说起来，或许我也该练一练武器了，下次遇到这种情况，就不会手无缚鸡之力。\"怨念极大地看着手环"}
{"time": 1752429848, "type": "recv", "message_id": "559231681", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "过个侦查"}
{"time": 1752429907, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1904021802", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。ra侦查"}
{"time": 1752429907, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1904021802", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[天宫安]进行技能[侦查:70]检定: 1D100=48 成功，春风得意马蹄急，一日看尽长安花"}
{"time": 1752430117, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1144666298", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "你看见格林愣神了一下，说道“可以是可以啦，不过下次遇到这种情况的时候你的手镯也摘下来了吧”"}
{"time": 1752430152, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2144099387", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“再说再怎么你也打不过那些专门学这个的”"}
{"time": 1752430166, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1272144557", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“还不如提升一下魔法威力呢”"}
{"time": 1752430188, "type": "recv", "message_id": "612923885", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...格林刚刚在看什么?\""}
{"time": 1752430284, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2076707081", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“嗯？”格林一脸不知道你在说啥的样子“我在听你说话啊，不过这个摊子上有意思的武器还真挺多的”"}
{"time": 1752430497, "type": "recv", "message_id": "681507276", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"感觉有些奇怪，\"你的镯子感觉尽早摘掉会比较好。\""}
{"time": 1752430542, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1262717292", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这个事情...还要好好研究一下。\"话锋一转，\"格林之前不是委托了铁匠?打造了什么？\""}
{"time": 1752430559, "type": "recv", "message_id": "395675896", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“啊哈哈……”"}
{"time": 1752430579, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1767653179", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“一……一把匕首啦”"}
{"time": 1752430716, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1661306833", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"好像都没给阿桃看过?\"瞪着她"}
{"time": 1752430751, "type": "recv", "message_id": "831855311", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"老实说，当然在赤龙谷，阿桃要是死在那里，格林不会拿着那只匕首去找赤龙吧？\""}
{"time": 1752430884, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1397594182", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“不会，因为那个时候肯定打不过”"}
{"time": 1752430921, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1407108561", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“师傅你要看也不是不行啦，我放在房间了”"}
{"time": 1752430966, "type": "recv", "message_id": "545547645", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"真的?\"想起做的梦，摇摇头，\"好吧，去看看别的摊子吧。\""}
{"time": 1752430972, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1907568642", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(感觉该睡了)"}
{"time": 1752430987, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1570819510", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（我没意见）"}
