{"time": 1752483088, "type": "recv", "message_id": "421679556", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（好戏要来了）"}
{"time": 1752483352, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1231350241", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "格林跑向下一个建筑圆中心的摊子，你在后面追。由于现在所处位置是许多圆相交的部位，这里的岔路尤其的多，你只能勉强跟进格林的行踪"}
{"time": 1752483364, "type": "recv", "message_id": "635877658", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "过个侦查，聆听"}
{"time": 1752483479, "type": "recv", "message_id": "757176130", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。ra侦查"}
{"time": 1752483479, "type": "reply", "message_id": "757176130", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[天宫安]进行技能[侦查:70]检定: 1D100=74 失败，人面不知何处去，桃花依旧笑春风"}
{"time": 1752483481, "type": "recv", "message_id": "215706042", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。ra聆听"}
{"time": 1752483481, "type": "reply", "message_id": "215706042", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[天宫安]进行技能[聆听:60]检定: 1D100=9 极难成功，流水落花春去也，天上人间"}
{"time": 1752483942, "type": "recv", "message_id": "679534250", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "你听到道路深处传来了杂乱的脚步声，似乎是有人在竭尽全力地逃跑，接着传来一句清脆的咒语声，什么东西摔破的声音，风呼啸而过的声音。一阵浓雾将你所处的街道完全覆盖，雾的组成不想是普通的水，行走在雾中你的视觉和听觉都遭到了压制，就连行动也因粘腻的雾气而变得缓慢了一些"}
{"time": 1752484089, "type": "recv", "message_id": "835949587", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "当然你也丢失了格林的踪影"}
{"time": 1752484092, "type": "recv", "message_id": "322733066", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"啧...\"顺着格林走的方向一路追过去"}
{"time": 1752484112, "type": "recv", "message_id": "385178768", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"偏偏这种时候...\""}
{"time": 1752484135, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1168267320", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "过一个幸运"}
