{"time": 1752508934, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1062806707", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“什么目的？”清脆的声音响起，她左手随意挽了个剑花，随后方向朝向你身上"}
{"time": 1752508987, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1730363099", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“没什么，只是路过，命运与我诉说此处或有相遇，于是我来了。”"}
{"time": 1752509020, "type": "recv", "message_id": "856555167", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "保持临危不乱的状态，“却不知是为何事？”"}
{"time": 1752509356, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1033297744", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "她眉头微皱，或许是懒得和你掰扯，步伐移动，竟是瞬间就拉近了你们二人之间的距离，比身影更快的，是她手中的玄黑长剑"}
{"time": 1752509439, "type": "recv", "message_id": "810971008", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶诶..阿桃只是普通人啦。\"连连后退，\"对不起对不起。\""}
{"time": 1752509685, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2143703251", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "就在女子的剑锋离你只有几尺远的时候，你听到身后传来惊讶的声音“咦？你在这啊，可算找到你……师傅小心！”"}
{"time": 1752509861, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1863590584", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"别过来！\"立刻回身扑倒格林"}
{"time": 1752510419, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1364930933", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "你回身的那阵功夫，玄黑长剑已经向你袭来，格林以极快的速度挡在了你身前，只听见“叮”的一声，格林手中不知道哪里掏出来的匕首被砍断弹飞，长剑带来的冲击力使格林重重地撞在你的身上，两人一起摔倒在地上"}
{"time": 1752510469, "type": "recv", "message_id": "997907845", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“诶...”立刻站起身把格林护在身后，“格林..快走”"}
{"time": 1752510476, "type": "recv", "message_id": "162885084", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“嘶！……好…痛…”格林发出小声的哀嚎"}
{"time": 1752510523, "type": "recv", "message_id": "602224286", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（你先别急）"}
{"time": 1752510542, "type": "recv", "message_id": "815556740", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（我先别急）"}
{"time": 1752510560, "type": "recv", "message_id": "495709136", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（而且你怎么在有个人压在身上的情况下快速起身）"}
