{"time": 1752859065, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1529238994", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（不能自己找事做吗（）"}
{"time": 1752859092, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1199550356", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "起床，照例直接去餐厅"}
{"time": 1752859226, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1076166495", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "你来到餐厅，领主正在看报纸，格林和吉诺大概吃完了去练剑了"}
{"time": 1752859333, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1366079763", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "倒也没什么特别想说的话，安静地吃完早餐，今天打算去外面逛一逛"}
{"time": 1752859415, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1875854531", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "只是突然想起了什么，开口“我的杖，领主先生”"}
{"time": 1752859532, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1321471323", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "领主示意管家去取你的魔杖“今天要出门吗？”"}
{"time": 1752859642, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1518303455", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“稍微出趟门，晚饭可以不用留了。”打个哈欠，站起身收拾一下着装，至于根本没打理完全翘起来的头发，就更懒得管了"}
{"time": 1752859725, "type": "recv", "message_id": "334923743", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“注意一下安全，最近有一些奇怪的人在搞特殊集会，说是宣扬什么‘神’的光辉”"}
{"time": 1752859771, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1561120522", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "注：你的记忆里，这个世界不存在宗教信仰"}
{"time": 1752859784, "type": "recv", "message_id": "418511798", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“集会？神？那是什么？”皱着眉头"}
{"time": 1752859854, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1762095675", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“谁知道呢，他们宣称他们的神可以赐予祝福，是至高存在”"}
{"time": 1752859883, "type": "recv", "message_id": "892870059", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“实际上是不是真正存在也不好说”"}
{"time": 1752859921, "type": "recv", "message_id": "641231131", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“不过他们倒是有些手段，据情报说部分人施展出了非凡的能力”"}
{"time": 1752859958, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2015665716", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“非凡的能力？”歪着脑袋，一只手垫着，“什么？”"}
{"time": 1752859961, "type": "recv", "message_id": "527509343", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“魔法不就是了”"}
{"time": 1752859966, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2100212918", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“魔法不就是吗？”"}
{"time": 1752860244, "type": "recv", "message_id": "745797452", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不过没事吧，我只是想出去逛逛。也不会参与什么集会。\"站起身伸个懒腰"}
{"time": 1752860323, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1255365869", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“好像说是把手放上去就能治疗疾病，听说还有其他，这些魔法能做到吗？”"}
{"time": 1752860368, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1642693453", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(治疗魔术?有吗)"}
{"time": 1752860382, "type": "recv", "message_id": "403661089", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（显然没有）"}
{"time": 1752860398, "type": "recv", "message_id": "495183989", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（不是和你说都是成属性的吗）"}
{"time": 1752860443, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1430506655", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这样，那我倒是有些好奇了，他们的集会地点在哪里?\""}
{"time": 1752860473, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1141967794", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（这种世界观的治疗魔法和元素魔法都是不同体系的）"}
{"time": 1752860490, "type": "recv", "message_id": "63576206", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（你可以理解成这个世界的治疗魔法刚开始出现吧）"}
{"time": 1752860501, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1320491215", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（OK）"}
{"time": 1752860522, "type": "recv", "message_id": "343087747", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“啊呀，我的本意是，离那群人远点会比较安全”"}
{"time": 1752860554, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1181463793", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“这也算是研究啦，阿桃当然会去一趟的。”"}
{"time": 1752860633, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1818877425", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"领主不如告诉我在哪里集会哦\""}
{"time": 1752860723, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1166091165", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "起身，等等自己的杖送过来"}
{"time": 1752860735, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1459685258", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“集会地点倒是不固定，不过他们在西边的那个山坡有一个小诊所”"}
{"time": 1752860855, "type": "recv", "message_id": "390163508", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "902737966", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“收到。”伸展一下四肢，倒是有段时间没动过了"}
